{"The `record.save` call silently swallows failures - if the save fails due to a database error, the statistics update is lost without any indication. Should use `record.save` with a log on failure, or `save!` wrapped in a rescue to avoid silent data loss.": 0.43477439880371094, "The spec stubs `BlockedEmail.should_block?` but does not stub `SiteSetting.email_domains_whitelist` or `SiteSetting.email_domains_blacklist`. If either setting has a value in the test environment, the whitelist/blacklist check will run first and may add an error before `BlockedEmail.should_block?` is reached, causing the 'doesn't add an error' test on line 10 to produce a false positive.": 0.7475576400756836}